1", "author": {"steamid": "76561198322391641", "personaname": "slimarmour", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198322391641/", "num_games_owned": 104, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 19600, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 108, "playtime_at_review": 10483, "last_played": 1787433276, "avatar": "126f531d9caa3a71a31c7b78815243f98cf1ce0f"}, "language": "russian", "review": "Incredibly cool concept and game, completely ruined as a result of poor quality web component. After 4 hours of playing, there is only one desire - to pass the game. I bought this game to play with a friend, and the only time we were able to play was on the first day after purchase, the next day the game simply closed all the possibility of playing online for me, neither connecting nor playing with friends. Rebooting, reinstalling the game, disabling the overlay and cross-platform - nothing helped! As a result, after 4 hours of playing, I’m actively thinking about demanding my money back, since I don’t want to play this alone!\n\nUPD: Game was fixed and now i can join lobbies and friends hosts. If today there will be no server casualties i will change this report.\n\nUPD 29.10.24: Game became much better, yes there was a big crisis, because of Sony dumb management, but on the other hand, developers now at least listening to their community\n\nUPD 04.11.24: Lags and Errors came back, again game became unplayable. 50% of games you have connection issues, other 50 - your teammates(and not only one, at least two at most cases). Yes game is still really cool, because of gameplay and concept, but Errors and lags(which appeared at 1-st november) still killing most fun.((\n\nUPD 01.12.2024: Two weeks ago game became stable again. GJ.", "timestamp_created": 1708724998, "timestamp_updated": 1733062511, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159093434", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059398472", "personaname": "Gaspar4ik", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198059398472/", "num_games_owned": 60, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 9643, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 985, "last_played": 1786562207, "avatar": "c4e4c66e3737890ff05b5a86a5d6ee1231dce1da"}, "language": "russian", "review": "Афигенно, 10 демократий из 10", "timestamp_created": 1708724881, "timestamp_updated": 1708724881, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159093258", "author": {"steamid": "76561199001053737", "personaname": "Coffin_Lid (｡>﹏<｡)", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199001053737/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 9340, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 632, "last_played": 1771348172, "avatar": "fe21be926e1ed6d1d86f8891af4a6f7813267749"}, "language": "russian", "review": "PIZDATA IGRA", "timestamp_created": 1708724730, "timestamp_updated": 1708724730, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159092953", "author": {"steamid": "76561198192937775", "personaname": "утяжелитель", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vae